    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      241.45,
      547.24,
      277.48
    ],
    "text": "Given at Colombo, under the seal of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, on this 02nd day of April TwoThousand and Fifteen. By order of His Excellency,",
